{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A resource-management adventure simulation game. In the new land of Terrarum, you will inherit a territory as a descendant of the Francz family and become the town mayor, tasked with settling artisans and adventurers. Together, you will build and expand the town.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>\u2014Develop Your Territory\u2014</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the town from the ground up, establishing production chains in farming, industry, forestry, fishing, and livestock to restore its prosperity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>\u2014Recruit Residents\u2014</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire hundreds of craftsmen and travelers, each with unique skills to help the town thrive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>\u2014Explore the World\u2014</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send townsfolk on expeditions to uncover rare resources and treasures for your settlement.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>\u2014More Features\u2014</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy diverse gameplay like vocational tournaments, guilds, world bosses, and more to enrich town life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3864100?t=1754532209","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3864100?t=1754532209","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864100/77c015f407929fd627d93c3ec23dce04c76d7c93/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754532209","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864100/77c015f407929fd627d93c3ec23dce04c76d7c93/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754532209","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A resource-management adventure simulation game. In the new land of Terrarum, you will inherit a territory as a descendant of the Francz family and become the town mayor, tasked with settling artisans and adventurers. Together, you will build and expand the town.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>\u2014Develop Your Territory\u2014</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the town from the ground up, establishing production chains in farming, industry, forestry, fishing, and livestock to restore its prosperity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>\u2014Recruit Residents\u2014</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire hundreds of craftsmen and travelers, each with unique skills to help the town thrive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>\u2014Explore the World\u2014</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send townsfolk on expeditions to uncover rare resources and treasures for your settlement.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>\u2014More Features\u2014</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy diverse gameplay like vocational tournaments, guilds, world bosses, and more to enrich town life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Electronic Soul"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864100/58a66f4ce283ec6eee93a18989af992eac295fac/header.jpg?t=1754532209","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Tales of Terrarum","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5GHz<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> HD4400<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["CYSTUDIO"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","des